## Purpose
Compare additional Indian retail API options without mistaking free trading for free data.

## Tasks
- [ ] DhanHQ: data entitlement, daily/intraday history, exclusive end boundaries and security IDs.
- [ ] Angel One SmartAPI: actual historical docs, auth, depth, quotas and terms beyond JS shell.
- [ ] Shoonya: current OAuth/history APIs, quotas and differences from older Noren SDKs.
- [ ] Flattrade Pi: retrieve actual docs and qualify history, login, plan and terms.
- [ ] Alice Blue ANT: current a3 API generation, history availability, fees and credentials.
- [ ] Complete the common provider qualification separately for all five options.

## Acceptance criteria
